<title>USA: China buys U.S. soyoil, cancels soymeal - USDA.</title>
<headline>China buys U.S. soyoil, cancels soymeal - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>China bought 39,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean oil during the week ending Feb 20, U.S. Agriculture Department said Thursday in its weekly Export Sales Report.</p>
<p>USDA also reported that China cancelled 20,000 tonnes of soybean meal purchases during that same week.</p>
</text>
